    "description": "TDK, Maxell, and Memorex Blank Audio Cassette Tapes\n10 Piece Lot with Storage Case\nType I and Type II Formulations\nThis collection features 10 vintage blank audio cassette tapes from leading manufacturers TDK, Maxell, and Memorex. These tapes represent the standard for analog home recording from the late 1980s through the 1990s, offering a mix of Type I Normal Bias and Type II High Position (Chrome) formulations. The lot is accompanied by a TDK-branded soft nylon carrying case designed for secure storage and transport of a cassette library.\n5 TDK High Position Type II tapes: includes two SA-90 and three SA-X100 cassettes\n4 Maxell UR 90 Normal Bias Type I tapes for everyday recording\n1 Memorex dB C60 Normal Position Type I ferric cassette\nTDK/Coast branded black nylon soft case with zipper closure and internal organizers\nCondition:\nAll 10 cassette tapes are factory sealed in their original cellophane packaging. The nylon storage case is in good condition with a fully functional zipper and intact interior slots. The external branding and logo patches are clear and legible. Sold as-is due to the nature of vintage magnetic media.",
